{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And when she came before the king.</b> The meaning: for Haman plotted to destroy the Jews, and when Esther came to the king and pleaded for her people, the king said that they should write with the document to revoke his evil plot; therefore the first documents were annulled — the meaning of \"therefore\" is the second one [Esther 8:5]."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:23.270017260Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}